Self-modifying code: a store that leaves a code page's bytes unchanged
invalidates no translated block (M9 track, docs/tracks/m9-tcg-aarch64.md).
The store slow path compares the bytes about to be written with what is
there before notdirty_write; `-accel tcg,smc-same-value=off` restores the
old behaviour. See the comment on notdirty_write and the patch README row.
Test: tools/smc-guest-test.py.

